{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Andarium is on the App Store" : {
      "comment" : "The title of the card that tells a TestFlight tester the app is also on the App Store. 'App Store' and 'TestFlight' stay as they are in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AndariumがApp Storeに登場"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andarium已上架App Store"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andarium已在App Store上架"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay on this TestFlight beta for the latest features, or get the App Store version for a more stable experience." : {
      "comment" : "The card's message: the TestFlight beta has the latest features, the App Store version is more stable.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最新機能をいち早く使うなら、このTestFlightベータ版のままで。より安定した動作を求めるなら、App Store版をどうぞ。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "继续使用TestFlight测试版，可抢先体验最新功能；改用App Store版本，体验更稳定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "繼續使用TestFlight測試版，可搶先體驗最新功能；改用App Store版本，體驗更穩定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching keeps your virtual machine, but it may not start until the App Store version catches up with this beta." : {
      "comment" : "The card's second line: switching keeps the virtual machine, which cannot start on an App Store version whose Android is older than the one the virtual machine last ran with.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切り替えても仮想マシンは残りますが、App Store版がこのベータ版に追いつくまで起動できないことがあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改用后虚拟机会保留，但在App Store版本跟上这个测试版之前，可能无法启动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改用後虛擬機器會保留，但在App Store版本跟上這個測試版之前，可能無法啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View in App Store" : {
      "comment" : "The card's button, which opens this app's page in the App Store.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Storeで見る"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在App Store中查看"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在App Store中檢視"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the App Store" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver's hint for the card's button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Storeを開きます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开App Store"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開App Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Andarium on the App Store" : {
      "comment" : "The row in Info that opens this app's page in the App Store.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App StoreのAndarium"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store上的Andarium"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store上的Andarium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New features arrive in this TestFlight beta first. The App Store version is more stable." : {
      "comment" : "The note under the row in Info.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新機能はまずこのTestFlightベータ版に届きます。App Store版はより安定しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新功能会先在这个TestFlight测试版中推出。App Store版本更稳定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新功能會先在這個TestFlight測試版中推出。App Store版本更穩定。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
